  "solution": "Concept Used: \n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/39d5d53fbef7cb246c82384c70b63b0287aa26f6cdb11ad3d427215025057797.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n4(1)/(3) ÷[2 (2)/(3)-(1)/(3) ×(4 (1)/(2)-3 (1)/(3))]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ [8/3 – 1/3 × (9/2 – 10/3)]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ [8/3 – 1/3 × (27 – 20)/6]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ [8/3 – 1/3 × 7/6]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ [8/3 – 7/18]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ [(48 – 7)/18]\n\n⇒ 13/3 ÷ 41/18\n\n⇒ 13/3 × 18/41\n\n⇒ 78/41\n\n⇒ 1(37)/(41)\n\n**∴ The required value is 1(37)/(41)**",
